\newlabel{tab:theta}{{3}{10}{Barnes--Hut accuracy and timing for $N = 1000$ as a function of opening angle $\theta $. Optimal $\theta \approx 0.5$ provides 2.4\% RMS force error at $11.5\times $ speedup over exact summation. \relax }{table.caption.13}{}}
